{title: Pyar Deewana Hota Hai}
{artist: Kishore Kumar R D Burman}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D] [Cadd9],        Pyaar diwaanaa hotaa hai,
[D],        mastaanaa hotaa hain.
[D] [C],        Har khushee se, har gam se,
[D],        begaanaa hotaa hain.
[D] [G],        Shama kahe parwane se pare chala ja
[Am] [D],        Meri tarah jal jayega yaha nahi aa
[D] [Cadd9] [D],        Wo nahi sunata us ko jal jana hota hai
[D] [C],        Har khushee se, har gam se,
[D],        begaanaa hotaa hain.
[D] [G],        Rahe koi sau parado me dare sharam se
[Am] [D],        Najar aji lakh churaye koi sanam se
[D] [Cadd9] [D],        Aa hi jata hay jis pe dil aana hota hai
[D] [C],        Har khushee se, har gam se,
[D],        begaanaa hotaa hain.
[D] [G],        Suno kisi shayar ne ye, kaha bahot khub
[Am] [D],        Mana kare duniya lekin mere mehaboob.
[D] [Cadd9] [D],        Wo chhalak jata hai jo paimana hota hai
[D] [C],        Har khushee se, har gam se,
[D],        begaanaa hotaa hain.
